# Algorithm LS2 re-implemented in Python from numeric valuations (src/local_search.py, function ls2_numeric): every
# decision uses the numbers; every Phase-1 step is checked (Pareto improvement, EFX0 by the raw definition, junk-free,
# bundles <= 2 goods) and every output is complete, EFX0 (raw definition) with at most one bundle of > 2 goods.
## exhaustive: python src/local_search.py pyalg n (every profile of every connected core, realization (4, 3, 2))
